s":[[1,"You are Running Venus - Ketu Vimsottari Dasa: Understand its Impact on Your Life"]],"type":"string"},"body":{"docs":{"1":0},"orderedDocs":[[1,"  Emails/html \n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\nYou are Running Venus - Ketu Vimsottari Dasa: Understand its Impact on Your Life\n\n┬á\n\nIndastro Horoscope Series\n\nLavina RamkissoonΓÇÖs Timeline\n\n┬á\n\nYou are going through the major┬áVimsottari dasa of Venus with the minor period of Ketu that operates for 1 years 2 months & 0 days. The Dasa results are that this period is one of brilliance & rise due to intellectual competence. Great time for rise in your circles as well as within government & society circles.\n\n┬á\n\n**LetΓÇÖs begin with what is Vimsottari Dasa:** If your concept of the Dasa system is not clear then you should know that it is a uniquely Vedic tool that runs on a cycle of 120 years that is split into 9 uneven parts owned by all 9 planet recognized by Vedic Astrology. The importance of Vedic Dasa is clear when we realize that whenever you have experienced a change in life, whether for good or for worse, the reason behind it has always been a change in your operating Dasa, since the dasa signals which planet is ruling your destiny currently. Vimsottari dasa is about timing trends in your professional, financial as well as personal matters irrespective of its tenure. You could have an amazingly strong planet in your birth chart but if that particular planet's Dasa does not operate at the right stage in your life, it would be like a 'rain in the ocean', amounting to no benefit. Similarly, you might have observed some child wonders & some very late successes in life. All these happen due to a benevolent Dasa becoming operational either very early or very late in their life.\n\n┬á\n\n**Your Dasa Cycle:** As you move ahead in life, you should remember that the following dasa are going to operate for you :\n\n┬á\n\nDasa in Operation\n\nTime Period\n\nGeneral effects\n\nSun - Sun\n\n0 year 3 months & 18 days\n\nThe period promises much that you will get from your father, your spiritual energy & people in power. It a period to look up & with confidence about your competence.\n\nSun -┬áMoon\n\n0 year 6 months & 0 days\n\nThis period will see both your parents and their legacy play an important role in your life. Ego & family values will play a string part for you during this period.\n\nSun - Mars\n\n0 years 4 months & 6 days\n\nThe period will bring ego & competence to the fore. You can expect some great results with people in power if you can keep your temper in check.\n\n┬á\n\n**Vimsottari Dasa Analysis Report:** The dasa analysis report will work out the combined chemistry of all 9 planets on your fortune and destiny. The most amazing part of the dasa story is the contradictions that sometimes come up as a planet that brings a career elevation also creates health problems for mother at times OR a career downfall could also bring in an opportunity in an overseas location creating the next path for you, bringing a 360 degree view of how the planet will play a part in your destiny and the karmic effects that would play out. The report can be request for 3,5 or 7 such *Vimsottari dasa* periods which could span between 5 & 15 years, depending on the planets in operation. The report will also cover Vedic Remedies that will bring power to the planets that are operating in your life to help increase success or cut down the challenges... **Read More** & **Order**\n\n┬á\n\nThe *Dasa system* has been in operation for more than 2000 years in India. It has turned out to be the backbone of Vedic Astrology & in the hands of an expert astrologer, is an infallible tool to predict your life story.\n\n┬á\n\nBlessings  \nPt. Punarvasu\n\n┬á\n\nOrder Now\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n2025 Career report\n\n2025 is year when your career & profession will undergo many changes. Saturn will run through it most powerful degrees in Aquarius & then finally switch in April to Pisces bringing the transit to hit a high crescendo before switching gears and getting into a new phase of building... **Read More**\n\n┬á\n\nIndepth Detailed Horoscope Reading\n\n2024 was an active year that brought with it opportunities for success as well challenges. The planetary combinations of 2025 need us to look at the year pragmatically since the year is loaded with many combinations that will come in after 5 to 13 years respectively. **Read More**\n\n┬á\n\nCareer Reboot\n\nProfessional success, achievements, recognition and our value to the society that drives us more than financial gains. We need to understand that success is part destiny, part hard work & part reducing resistance in our career path... **Read More**\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\nWhat do our Clients say about Us?\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\nThis is really good and was most relatable.\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n**Tia**  \n┬áKabul, Afghanistan\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\nMy free report was very informative and helpful in understanding my behavioral patterns and how to navigate situations based upon that.\n\n┬á\n\n**Antonio**  \nNew York, USA\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\nExcellent and in-depth analysis.\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n**Shashwat**  \nNew Delhi, India\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n┬á\n\n www.indastro.com\n\n┬á\n\nClick here to unsubscribe."]],"type":"string"},"rawBody":{"docs":{"1":0},"orderedDocs":[[1,"TEST RAW BODY SNIPPET"]],"type":"string"},"from":{"docs":{"1":0},"orderedDocs":[[1,"Indastro -  Pt. Punarvasu <ptpunarvasu@indastro.com>"]],"type":"string"},"to":{"docs":{"1":0},"orderedDocs":[[1,"undefined <absolutesportsfan@gmail.com>"]],"type":"string"},"sentAt":{"docs":{"1":0},"orderedDocs":[[1,"2025-01-13T11:53:48.000Z"]],"type":"string"},"threadId":{"docs":{"1":0},"orderedDocs":[[1,"1945f8352995dcee"]],"type":"string"}},"enabled":true,"isSorted":true},"language":"english"}
